  "2": [
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Tinch holatdan tekis tezlanuvchan harakatda $n$-sekundda o‘tilgan yo‘l $s_n=\\frac a2(2n-1)$, dastlabki 3 s dagi yo‘l $\\frac{a\\cdot9}{2}$. Harakat $t$ s davom etgan bo‘lsa:"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "\\frac a2(2t-1)=\\frac{9a}{2}\\;\\Rightarrow\\;2t-1=9\\;\\Rightarrow\\;t=5\\ \\text{s}"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**A)** 5 s"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "3": [
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Nyutonning ikkinchi qonuni $a=F/m$: massa o‘zgarmasa, tezlanish kuchga to‘g‘ri proporsional."
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**B)** 4 marta"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "4": [
   {
    "t": "given",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "$M=6$ kg (taxta), $m=2$ kg (brusok), $\\mu=0{,}3$, $F=4$ N (brusokka), pastki sirt silliq"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Avval jismlar birga harakatlanadi deb faraz qilamiz:"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "a=\\frac{F}{M+m}=\\frac{4}{8}=0{,}5\\ \\text{m/s}^2"
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Taxtani faqat ishqalanish kuchi tezlantiradi: $F_{\\text{ishq}}=Ma=3$ N. Bu tinchlikdagi ishqalanishning maksimal qiymatidan kichik ($\\mu mg=6$ N), demak faraz to‘g‘ri."
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**D)** 0,5 m/s²"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "5": [
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Yer sirti yaqinidagi orbitada $\\frac{mv^2}{R}=mg$, ya’ni $v^2=gR$:"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "E_k=\\frac{mv^2}{2}=\\frac{mgR}{2}=\\frac{4\\cdot10\\cdot6{,}4\\cdot10^6}{2}=1{,}28\\cdot10^8\\ \\text{J}"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**A)** 1,28·10⁸ J"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "6": [
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "$A$ nuqtadagi elastiklik kuchi undan pastdagi hamma narsaning og‘irligini ushlab turadi: arqonning pastki 30 cm qismi ($\\frac{30}{40}\\cdot4=3$ kg) va yuk (6 kg):"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "T_A=(3+6)\\cdot10=90\\ \\text{N}"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**C)** 90 N"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "7": [
   {
    "t": "given",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "$L=140$ cm, $m=1200$ kg; tayanchlar chap uchdan 20 cm va 80 cm da (o‘ng uchdan 60 cm)"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Chap uch ko‘tarila boshlaganda balka o‘ng tayanch atrofida aylanadi, chap tayanch bosimi nolga tushadi. Og‘irlik markazi chap uchdan 70 cm da, ya’ni o‘ng tayanchdan 10 cm chapda. O‘ng tayanchga nisbatan momentlar:"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "F\\cdot80=mg\\cdot10\\;\\Rightarrow\\;F=\\frac{12\\,000\\cdot10}{80}=1500\\ \\text{N}=1{,}5\\ \\text{kN}"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**B)** 1,5 kN"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "8": [
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Idish suv bilan to‘la, suv idish bilan birga tezlanish bilan harakatlanadi. Devorlarning suvga natijaviy gorizontal ta’siri suvga shu tezlanishni beradi:"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "m=\\rho a^3=1000\\cdot64=64\\,000\\ \\text{kg},\\qquad F=ma=64\\,000\\cdot1{,}5=96\\,000\\ \\text{N}=96\\ \\text{kN}"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**D)** 96 kN"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "9": [
