  "18": [
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Shar tashqarisida maydon nuqtaviy zaryadnikidek. Nuqta markazdan $2R$ masofada, $Q=\\sigma\\cdot4\\pi R^2$:"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "E=\\frac{Q}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0(2R)^2}=\\frac{\\sigma}{4\\varepsilon_0}=\\frac{54{,}6\\cdot10^{-9}}{4\\cdot8{,}85\\cdot10^{-12}}\\approx1540\\ \\text{V/m}=1{,}54\\ \\text{kV/m}"
   },
